    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opponent's Shooting phase, right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 2 units of yours:\n\n- 1 **DEATH GUARD** unit targeted by at least 1 attack from the attacking unit\n- 1 **POXWALKERS** unit no more than 3\" from that unit, which both it and the attacking unit can see\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever an attack would be allocated to a model in the **DEATH GUARD** unit, if the attacking model can see the **POXWALKERS** unit and that unit is eligible as a target for the attack, skip the saving throw. Instead, destroy as many **POXWALKERS** models as the attack's Damage.",
